// Title: Potential Russian APT Credential Theft Activity
// Rule ID: b83f5166-9237-4b5e-9cd4-7b5d52f4d8ee
// Severity: critical
// Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.t1552.001, attack.t1003.003, detection.emerging-threats
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules-emerging-threats/2019/TA/Bear-APT-Activity/proc_creation_win_apt_bear_activity_gtr19.yml
